Third-party material not covered by this license

The rubricText fields in src/thresholds.json quote the level descriptions of
"Como saber si tus tests automatizados sirven: la rubrica de 7 criterios para
auditar una suite" by Adriana Troche Robles, published on Calidad sin Humo
(https://calidadsinhumo.com/guias/rubrica-para-juzgar-una-suite-de-tests/).
That text is the author's work, is reproduced to record which sentence each
threshold interprets, and is not licensed by this repository.
